        },
        {
          "text": "Na lango la samaki wakalijenga wana wa Senaa; wakazitia boriti zake, wakaisimamisha milango yake, na vyuma vyake, na makomeo yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na baada yao akafanyiza Meremothi, mwana wa Uria, mwana wa Hakosi. Na baada yao akafanyiza Meshulamu, mwana wa Berekia, mwana wa Meshezabeli. Na baada yao akafanyiza Sadoki, mwana wa Baana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
